From 3001c25a8392d01e3c1e1a7041ebef017cdc9f8c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bharat Dintakurti <bdintakurti@nvidia.com>
Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 14:15:43 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] drivers: add NVIDIA RTX Spark power profiles

Add an RTX Spark-specific cppc_cpufreq backend using the numeric EPP interface. Select EPP values per core type and update the CPUFreq governor for each profile and AC/battery state.

Reapply the selected settings after resume and gate the backend on the SMBIOS Type 4 processor version.
